when it's evidences of the
way humans work you know

01:12:36.040 --> 01:12:38.020
and they were deeply emotional and--

01:12:38.020 --> 01:12:41.127
But there was, and I know
this is true of you too

01:12:41.127 --> 01:12:44.494
but like I was journaling my prayers

01:12:44.494 --> 01:12:47.780
because I had a hard time
actually focusing on praying

01:12:47.780 --> 01:12:50.260
but there was a lot of praying.

01:12:50.260 --> 01:12:52.403
It was kind of a one-sided conversation

01:12:52.403 --> 01:12:57.403
but when you start to,
I could sense responses.

01:12:58.050 --> 01:13:00.950
Oh, yeah.
Like you read the you know

01:13:00.950 --> 01:13:03.070
they taught you, we were
taught to read the Bible

01:13:03.070 --> 01:13:06.300
and study the Bible in a
way that the Holy Spirit

01:13:06.300 --> 01:13:10.500
would bring things out of it
like you would gain insight

01:13:10.500 --> 01:13:13.480
and relating it to who you were

01:13:13.480 --> 01:13:16.380
and we would seek guidance

01:13:16.380 --> 01:13:19.600
on every single major decision

01:13:19.600 --> 01:13:21.826
and it's certain stints of my life

01:13:21.826 --> 01:13:23.867
every single minor decision.

01:13:23.867 --> 01:13:24.810
Yeah.

01:13:24.810 --> 01:13:29.810
And you really get a sense that you were

01:13:29.821 --> 01:13:34.640
that I was guided to make decisions by God

01:13:34.640 --> 01:13:37.226
I mean we even went through workbooks

01:13:37.226 --> 01:13:38.847
called "Experiencing God"

01:13:38.847 --> 01:13:40.950
"How to determine God's
will for your life"

01:13:40.950 --> 01:13:43.820
all of the, it's like we were trained

01:13:43.820 --> 01:13:48.820
the practices in order to connect with God

01:13:51.330 --> 01:13:53.690
and to be guided by God.

01:13:53.690 --> 01:13:56.560
But for me, making
decisions was a huge thing

01:13:56.560 --> 01:14:00.120
like my journal was filled with everything

01:14:00.120 --> 01:14:02.123
that I talked about and
then the second thing

01:14:02.123 --> 01:14:03.540
that was filled with

01:14:03.540 --> 01:14:08.540
was me trying to assess
if I could marry Christy,

01:14:08.607 --> 01:14:10.500
if she was the one for me

01:14:10.500 --> 01:14:13.300
like I obsessed about this and I felt like

01:14:15.363 --> 01:14:18.650
on one hand, I became convinced that like

01:14:18.650 --> 01:14:21.180
okay God is blessing this decision

01:14:21.180 --> 01:14:24.630
this is a wise decision,
this is the right decision.

01:14:24.630 --> 01:14:27.410
On the other hand, I
feel like I missed out

01:14:27.410 --> 01:14:28.680
on a lot of like experience and

01:14:28.680 --> 01:14:31.331
like falling in love with my wife

01:14:31.331 --> 01:14:33.880
because I wanted it to be such a,

01:14:33.880 --> 01:14:36.470
I wanted it to be something
where God granted me permission

01:14:36.470 --> 01:14:39.056
and give me a sign or
give me the specifics

01:14:39.056 --> 01:14:44.020
and I felt like I got
that, those are all aspects

01:14:44.020 --> 01:14:47.400
of my active relationship with God.

01:14:47.400 --> 01:14:48.850
You're the one who made the statement

01:14:48.850 --> 01:14:50.270
I didn't make the statement

01:14:50.270 --> 01:14:52.330
but it's true of me too.

01:14:52.330 --> 01:14:54.060
I believe that I did have

01:14:54.060 --> 01:14:59.060
a real back-and-forth conversational
relationship with God.

01:15:00.813 --> 01:15:04.980
I just thought that I wasn't good at it

01:15:04.980 --> 01:15:07.630
and that all the stuff
I was trained to do,

01:15:07.630 --> 01:15:09.880
I just wasn't motivated enough

01:15:09.880 --> 01:15:13.530
and it was my shortcomings not God's

01:15:13.530 --> 01:15:15.276
that that made me feel distant.

01:15:15.276 --> 01:15:17.630
Yeah well, you know when you're on staff

01:15:17.630 --> 01:15:19.600
with Campus Crusade you have,

01:15:19.600 --> 01:15:23.517
you're encouraged to do something called

01:15:23.517 --> 01:15:25.951
"A day with the Lord" every month, right.

01:15:25.951 --> 01:15:26.784
Right.

01:15:26.784 --> 01:15:31.240
And this is essentially
a day-long devotional.

01:15:31.240 --> 01:15:33.360
You might have what we
call your quiet time

01:15:33.360 --> 01:15:34.830
or your devotion time every single morning

01:15:34.830 --> 01:15:37.350
where you get up and you
pray and you read the Bible

01:15:37.350 --> 01:15:42.350
which I was okay, yeah, I
had some good runs in there.

01:15:42.712 --> 01:15:45.133
It's pretty much a struggle
for most Christians.

01:15:46.127 --> 01:15:49.200
But I always loved the day with the Lord.

01:15:49.200 --> 01:15:50.033
You did?

01:15:50.033 --> 01:15:54.870
Oh, yeah I I loved it
and what I would do is

01:15:54.870 --> 01:15:56.390
I would take my Bible and my journal

01:15:56.390 --> 01:15:59.090
and I would go to some spot in nature

01:15:59.090 --> 01:16:00.170
and I would just sit there

01:16:00.170 --> 01:16:01.880
and I would just pray

01:16:01.880 --> 01:16:06.380
and basically, the funny thing is

01:16:06.380 --> 01:16:10.220
is I still do this, pretty regularly.

01:16:10.220 --> 01:16:12.547
I just don't call it
"A day with the Lord".

01:16:12.547 --> 01:16:15.586
I just go out into a spot in nature.

01:16:15.586 --> 01:16:18.890
I don't have the Bible,
I've got my journal.

01:16:18.890 --> 01:16:20.420
I might have a book or something

01:16:20.420 --> 01:16:22.200
that I'm reading at the time

01:16:22.200 --> 01:16:25.160
but I just sort through things, right.

01:16:25.160 --> 01:16:29.593
And it's just like now I
talk out loud to myself

01:16:29.593 --> 01:16:32.560
whereas I used to just
talk out loud to God

01:16:32.560 --> 01:16:36.097
but tangibly, practically, the
experience is no different.

01:16:36.097 --> 01:16:40.103
I'm not trying to yeah,
that may sound like sad

01:16:40.103 --> 01:16:42.540
or crass or whatever but
I'm just saying that.

01:16:42.540 --> 01:16:43.440
Not trying to be dismissive

01:16:43.440 --> 01:16:44.782
I'm just saying when I think back

01:16:44.782 --> 01:16:48.080
on what I was interpreting
as a two-way relationship

01:16:48.080 --> 01:16:50.620
where the Lord was again,

01:16:50.620 --> 01:16:52.340
I don't know the nature of the universe

01:16:52.340 --> 01:16:53.974
and maybe that I was tapping

01:16:53.974 --> 01:16:56.440
into some sort of
spiritual plane that exists

01:16:56.440 --> 01:16:58.520
that I don't fully grasp and understand

01:16:58.520 --> 01:16:59.770
and I'm still open to that.

01:16:59.770 --> 01:17:00.660
I hope so.

01:17:00.660 --> 01:17:01.493
Yeah.

01:17:01.493 --> 01:17:04.665
But I tend to think
that what was happening

01:17:04.665 --> 01:17:06.759
especially during those times

01:17:06.759 --> 01:17:08.272
is I was just getting away.

01:17:08.272 --> 01:17:11.570
I was extracting myself
from my day-to-day life

01:17:11.570 --> 01:17:13.095
and all the distractions there

01:17:13.095 --> 01:17:14.880
and I was just getting some time

01:17:14.880 --> 01:17:16.900
to just be still you know.

01:17:16.900 --> 01:17:19.340
Be still and be in a meditative state

01:17:19.340 --> 01:17:21.430
and kind of just things
come to the surface

01:17:21.430 --> 01:17:22.710
and you kind of work through things.

01:17:22.710 --> 01:17:24.640
It's like if you go to the grave site

01:17:24.640 --> 01:17:27.340
of someone that you love
and you talk to them

01:17:27.340 --> 01:17:29.790
and some people carry on
that kind of relationship

01:17:29.790 --> 01:17:31.400
for a very, very long time.

01:17:31.400 --> 01:17:33.910
That person never speaks back to them

01:17:33.910 --> 01:17:35.648
but there are tangible experiences

01:17:35.648 --> 01:17:38.530
and they remember what they looked like

01:17:38.530 --> 01:17:40.510
and they remember that
you know in the same way

01:17:40.510 --> 01:17:42.796
that your memories of a loved one

01:17:42.796 --> 01:17:46.040
are sort of, it's the raw material

01:17:46.040 --> 01:17:48.390
by which you have an ongoing
conversation with them

01:17:48.390 --> 01:17:49.680
after they die.

01:17:49.680 --> 01:17:53.200
I kind of feel like the
Bible and church tradition

01:17:53.200 --> 01:17:55.150
and what you're being
taught is the raw material

01:17:55.150 --> 01:17:57.872
for carrying on a relationship with Jesus

01:17:57.872 --> 01:18:00.811
that might just be a
conversation with yourself.

01:18:00.811 --> 01:18:03.817
That's my best guess as
to what's happening there

01:18:03.817 --> 01:18:07.423
as I always like to say, I could be wrong.

01:18:08.890 --> 01:18:09.860
You probably are.

01:18:09.860 --> 01:18:11.830
Right, I'm sure I am in some way.

01:18:11.830 --> 01:18:12.663
Yeah.

